# SPDX-License-Identifier: MPL-2.0
import tests/cadkernel/brep_place/checks.dl
import tests/cadkernel/brep_place/oracles.dl

set turn to a cad placement with axes (placement point [0.0,1.0,0.0]), (placement point [-1.0,0.0,0.0]) and (the cad z axis) at (the cad zero vector3)
set made to the cad cuboid at (the cad zero vector3) with size (placement point [10.0,4.0,6.0])
set moved to the cad transformed (made's value) by turn
check placement (moved's valid)
check placement solid (moved's value)
set bounds to the cad bounds of (moved's value)
check placement (bounds's valid)
check placement scalar (bounds's value's high's y) near 10.0
check placement scalar (bounds's value's low's x) near -4.0
set size to the cad size of (bounds's value)
check placement scalar (size's x * size's y * size's z) near 240.0
check placement scalar (placement boundary volume of (moved's value)) near 240.0
print "a_turn_moves_a_body_without_changing_its_size" as a line

set doubled to a cad placement with axes (placement point [2.0,0.0,0.0]), (placement point [0.0,2.0,0.0]) and (placement point [0.0,0.0,2.0]) at (the cad zero vector3)
set round to the cad cylinder body at (the cad zero vector3) with radius 3.0 and height 6.0
set grown to the cad transformed (round's value) by doubled
check placement (grown's valid)
check placement solid (grown's value)
check placement ((the cad worst vertex gap of (grown's value)) < 1e-9)
set surfaces to the cad keys of (grown's value's surfaces)
loop index from 0 to the length of surfaces:
    set surface to the cad node pointer for (the item at index in surfaces) in (grown's value's surfaces)
    if surface's kind = 1:
        check placement scalar (surface's cylinder's radius) near 6.0
free surfaces
set bounds to the cad bounds of (grown's value)
check placement scalar (bounds's value's high's z - bounds's value's low's z) near 12.0
set volume to placement boundary volume of (grown's value)
set expected to (3.141592653589793 * 36.0) * 12.0
check placement ((volume > (0.98 * expected)) and (volume <= expected))
print "a_scale_takes_the_radii_with_it" as a line

set mirror to a cad placement with axes (placement point [-1.0,0.0,0.0]), (the cad y axis) and (the cad z axis) at (the cad zero vector3)
check placement (mirror reflects cad orientation)
set ball to the cad sphere body at (placement point [2.0,0.0,0.0]) with radius 3.0
set mirrored to the cad transformed (ball's value) by mirror
check placement (mirrored's valid)
check placement solid (mirrored's value)
set faces to the cad face keys of (mirrored's value)
set face to the cad node pointer for (the item at 0 in faces) in (mirrored's value)
set sphere to the cad node pointer for (face's surface) in (mirrored's value)
set point to the cad point on (@intrinsic("dereference", sphere)) at parameters 0.0 and 0.0
set normal to the cad normal of (@intrinsic("dereference", sphere)) at parameters 0.0 and 0.0
check placement (normal's valid)
check placement ((the cad dot of (normal's value) and (the cad difference of point and (sphere's sphere's frame's origin))) > 0.0)
check placement (face's forward)
free faces
set bounds to the cad bounds of (mirrored's value)
check placement scalar (bounds's value's high's x) near 1.0
set volume to placement boundary volume of (mirrored's value)
set expected to ((4.0 / 3.0) * 3.141592653589793) * 27.0
check placement (volume > (0.98 * expected))
print "a_mirror_comes_back_the_right_way_out" as a line

set squash to a cad placement with axes (placement point [2.0,0.0,0.0]), (the cad y axis) and (the cad z axis) at (the cad zero vector3)
check placement (((the cad transformed (round's value) by squash)'s valid) = false)
set shear to a cad placement with axes (the cad x axis), (the cad x axis) and (the cad z axis) at (the cad zero vector3)
check placement (((the cad transformed (round's value) by shear)'s valid) = false)
print "a_squash_is_refused_rather_than_rounded_off" as a line

set little to the cad cuboid at (the cad zero vector3) with size (placement point [0.5,0.5,0.5])
set survey to the cad transformed (little's value) by (a cad placement at (placement point [512345.678,4512345.678,91.5]))
check placement (survey's valid)
check placement solid (survey's value)
check placement ((the cad worst vertex gap of (survey's value)) < 1e-6)
set bounds to the cad bounds of (survey's value)
set size to the cad size of (bounds's value)
check placement scalar (size's x * size's y * size's z) near 0.125
check placement ((the absolute value of ((placement boundary volume of (survey's value)) - 0.125)) < 1e-6)
print "a_body_moved_to_survey_coordinates_is_the_same_solid" as a line

set edges to the cad edge keys of (made's value)
loop index from 0 to the length of edges:
    set points to the cad edge points of (the item at index in edges) in (made's value) within 0.05
    check placement (points's valid)
    check placement ((the length of points's value's values) = 2)
free edges
set round to the cad cylinder body at (the cad zero vector3) with radius 5.0 and height 10.0
check placement ((placement maximum samples of (round's value) with sag 0.05) > 20)
set polylines to the cad edge polylines of (round's value) within 0.05
loop index from 0 to the length of (polylines's values):
    set points to the item at index in (polylines's values)
    loop cursor from 0 to the length of (points's values):
        set point to the item at cursor in (points's values)
        check placement scalar (the cad length of (a cad vector2 with x (point's x) and y (point's y))) near 5.0
print "a_straight_edge_needs_only_its_ends_and_a_round_one_does_not" as a line
check placement ((placement maximum samples of (round's value) with sag 0.001) > (placement maximum samples of (round's value) with sag 0.1))
print "a_finer_tolerance_asks_for_more_points" as a line
